Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.589 align:start position:0%
 
first time i played thor i was like  shirt off no worries we're talking 11  years of transformations not only for  chris hemsworth but for every character  throughout the entire thor franchise  we'll be discussing natalie portman's  insane workout routine tessa thompson's  mealtime secrets and christian bales  five hour long makeup process  number one  natalie portman is definitely no  stranger to intense transformations  she's done training regimens over 40  hours a week in preparation for black  swan so of course thor love and thunder  would be no different to become mighty  thor the only thing requested of her was  to get as big as possible and eat as  much as possible there are a lot of  protein shakes um like too many and i  don't want to have it  natalie found herself getting a little  annoyed at one particular vegetable that  kept getting served at every meal it was  like breakfast lunch and dinner would  have asparagus in that the only thing  that's available right now fun fact that  was a request from her co-star tessa  thompson because asparagus really helped  the muscles pop i was like hot tip tessa  so like now i won't complain about that  number two  speaking of tessa she definitely didn't  get off easy when it came to  transforming into her character valkyrie  right before heading off to australia to  film thor she was finishing up her role  as josie in the film annihilation  i had to start training for thor while  we were making annihilation one of the  big areas of training was all the swords  work not only did she have to master her  sword but she was also trained by  reginald brantley who is actually known  for training bodybuilding competitors  we're talking an intense amount of  cardio and weightlifting it seems like  this would be pretty grueling work for  anyone but tessa actually loved it  especially after coming out of a period  of being on the couch a lot to just feel  better in my body frankly number three  chris hemsworth has been training for  thor for over a decade now  so bulking up has become pretty natural  for him on his own he loves working out  it's actually become a bit of an  addiction for him but he describes  bulking up to thor size as pretty brutal  on his body  in an interview with center one of  chris's trainers speaks up about his  routine noting that the actor had to  consume a massive 4 500 calories a day  in order to fuel his gun-tastic  transformation  that's up to six meals a day  even chris's stunt double bobby holland  had to gain over 20 pounds of lean  muscle in under 10 weeks to convincingly  play thor's double  number 4 christian bale's career has  seen a plethora of insane  transformations  his process for turning into gore the  god butcher has less to do with him  bulking up or eating veggies but more so  the incredibly talented makeup team  behind the look he spends four hours in  the makeup chair at the beginning of the  day and over an hour and a half at the  end ain't just me it's  adam and it's emily and it's color as  well who bust their ass creating this  look number five  taika waititi had a similar experience  turning into korg being taken seriously  as a director when you're wearing  fractal pajamas is  not easy but of course being the  director adds a bit of comedic element  to it and you've got these dots all over  your face and stuff and you know it's  the most  um emasculating experience though tyka  is used to acting in his own films he  purposely made his scenes in the thor  franchise as simple as possible so he  could just enjoy playing the role  without a ton of pressure on his  shoulders  number six  legendary russell crowe has been  hilariously known for doing little to no  prep for his roles  i did no preparation whatsoever  i researched absolutely nothing but for  thor love and thunder he did have to do  a bit of accent work taika ytt spoke  with insider about russell crowe's  journey of transforming into zeus we  actually talked at length about the  accent we wondered if someone did a  greek accent of a greek god is it going  to be a farce will it be too silly  russell was very much wanting it to be  greek but i wasn't sure so we ended up  doing two versions of every take with  russell one in a greek accent and then  another in a british accent  number seven  also known as the incredible hulk  now mark's transformation is quite a bit  different than the other actors mostly  because his character is completely  animated and they put black dots  in specific places all over my face he  also has a camera attached to his head  that records all of his facial  expressions so my makeup process really  is where they record me doing a bunch of  different motions in the first two thor  movies mark had to do every single one  of his scenes by himself weeks before  the actors even stepped foot on set but  in ragnarok the technology advanced in a  way where he didn't have to do that  anymore and that makes a world of  difference you know we could do improv  we can improvise whole scenes together  now and they could capture all that  number eight this wasn't your average  transformation  what  jeff goldblum's transition into the  grand master for thor ragnarok is not  exactly the protein shake road like his  co-star natalie portman but more of a  makeup experimentation we camera tested  something that they'd sewn up  they said  let's do something else not only was  jeff part of the initial conversation  about his character's look but he also  got to vote on things he liked or  disliked we changed that costume and  then they had masterful hair people i  think they did my hair in eight  different ways he was super flexible  about the whole process and didn't  complain once  let's give it a try i love this this is  my favorite part on camera number nine  did you know tom hiddleston originally  auditioned for thor though everyone  thought he would be better suited for  loki it didn't spare him the hours of  intense training the rest of the cast is  pretty familiar with so he said chris  and tom go and train together there's  some tree trunks um in the garden for  firewood that unique training regimen  involved lifting tree trunks together  needless to say chris hemsworth and tom  hiddleston became fast friends  number 10  we obviously can't talk about loki  without bringing up matt damon now if  your kids are looking at you right now  like that's not tom hiddleston just tell  him i was loki in the 90s before it was  cool loki has had quite the  transformation throughout the mcu matt  damon spoke on the jess cage show about  taika waititi's comic decision of  bringing in matt damon we were kind of  reprising a cameo that luke hemsworth  and i did in the last one  apparently taika asked luke and matt to  kind of run that joke back and upgrade  it a little bit and that they did number  11  like christian bale we've got another  master of transformations here  not only does she get to wear these  super stylish as taika waititi put it  freckle pajamas for all the cgi shots  but she also got her own practical hella  helmet i think we nailed it it looks  when i first shot on her her walking  around the studio it was pretty  impressive  caitlyn chet was also pretty heavily  involved in hela's regular day-to-day  look  and i was saying well she can't wear  that all the time what's it like when  she doesn't have it on they let us have  a bit of free reign with that number 12.  now this was worth waiting for marvel  fans had been dying to see scourge the  executioner face off against thor long  before ragnarok came out so when carl  urban teased a little bit about his new  look for the film it was definitely a  big deal he even shared a picture on  twitter thanking taiwaititi for his new  clean-shaven look  we've got hours of time in the makeup  chair incredible practical and visual  effects and an insane amount of protein  shakes who do you think had the most  intense transformation in the thor  franchise

